   "source_tag": "_t",
   "args_order": null,
   "source": "Steamsaws use steam pressure to rotate a serrated metal blade at high speed.\nThose struck suffer severe lacerations and bleed for 10% of the damage done per turn for 5 turns (stacking).\nThey can be wielded in the main or off hand.\nVrmmmmm!",
   "target": "蒸汽链锯利用蒸汽压力驱动锯齿状金属刀片高速旋转。\n被蒸汽链锯击中的目标将会受到严重割伤，在5回合内每回合受到相当于10%所造成伤害的流血伤害，可以叠加。\n能装备在主手或者副手。\n滋滋滋！！！",
   "source_file": "/workspace/tome4-dlcs/orcs/tome-orcs/data/general/objects/steamsaw.lua (unpinned public DLC checkout)",
